Section: metapackages
Priority: optional
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Package: edemint-desktop
Version: 0.1
Maintainer: Edemint <hello@edemint.invalid>
Homepage: https://example.invalid/edemint
Architecture: all
Depends: edemint-base, @DEPS@
Description: Edemint desktop metapackage — Hyprland Wayland session
 The Edemint desktop metapackage pulls the Hyprland (wlroots) compositor
 and the full userland that makes it feel like a normal general-purpose
 Wayland desktop: portals, XWayland, Qt5/6 Wayland, the Hyprland UX layer
 (hyprlock/hypridle/wlogout/swayosd/cliphist/hyprshot/swappy/hyprpicker/
 kanshi), tray GUIs (nm-applet, blueman, pavucontrol), the polkit agent,
 fcitx5 (input method), baseline apps (firefox-esr, viewers, calc, disk
 utility), Flatpak, VA-API, codecs, broad font set, snapper + grub-btrfs,
 NM VPN plugins, AT-SPI + Orca. Pairs with the system services enabled by
 the Edemint branding hook.
